<title>USA: Pivot stock, warrants to trade separately.</title>
<headline>Pivot stock, warrants to trade separately.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pivot Rules Inc said Tuesday its common stock and warrants will trade separately on the Nasdaq Small Cap Market and the Boston Stock Exchange under the PVTR and PVTRW symbols, respectively, effective July 17.</p>
<p>The company's units will be delisted at the close of the market on July 16.</p>
<p>Pivot Rules makes, designs and sells a collection of golf lifestyle sportswear for men.</p>
</text>
